@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Admin" as User
participant "AdminPage" as UI
participant "FieldOperationController" as Controller
participant "FieldOperationService" as Service
participant "ExtraServiceRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-18: Manage Extra Services ==

User -> UI : 1. Create, edit or toggle an extra service
activate User
activate UI

UI -> UI : 2. saveService() / toggleServiceStatus()
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> UI : 3. Validate form/filter state
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> Controller : 4. POST /api/admin/services\nPUT /api/admin/services/{serviceId}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. createService(request) / updateService(id, request)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. Validate name, unit, price, stock and max quantity
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. findById(serviceId) / save(service)
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. INSERT/UPDATE extra_service
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. ExtraService
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Apply service type, inventory and status
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Negative price/stock or invalid max -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> UI : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI : 15. loadAdminServices(); refreshAll()
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI --> User : 16. Show service saved

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
